      "title": "Magma Block",
      "subtitle": "Minecraft",
      "icon": {
        "id": "minecraft:magma_block"
      },
      "description": [
        "Use Ex Deorum’s barrel recipe to turn Redstone and Lava into Netherrack. Hammer it into Crushed Netherrack and sieve it for Magma Cream; even a String Mesh works. Combine four Magma Cream into a Magma Block for Blast Bricks. The native Slimeball and Blaze Powder recipe is another option."
